Safety section	Check the description against the implicated contracts	**Current candidate: `e821ae747`**, a proof-scheduling-only successor to measured production source **`7e13e58e5`**; their complete `LiteDB/` trees match. The follow-up reviews have scoped fixes or explicit dispositions below. **Safety gate reopened:** the [new review of this head](https://github.com/JKamsker/LiteDB/pull/133#pullrequestreview-5365276527) raises two late-reader callback counterexamples (unleased snapshot ownership and cross-thread Shared close). Both are being independently reproduced and corrected. The completed measurements and running hosted checks are interim evidence, not final acceptance. Earlier green `eb01f346e` evidence is retained as interim, not substituted for this candidate.
