Safety section	Check the description against the implicated contracts	| Diagnostics and structural nits | Zero `ThreadID` is diagnostic. The unpruned per-path managed registry predates reuse and retains no native ownership/application graph. Scheduler duplication, unsupported drop/rename API shape and existing encoding are outside this correction. |
