Safety section	Check the description against the implicated contracts	Public compatibility: typed/BSON collections, Include/vector queries, indexes and `$cols`/`$indexes` metadata are bound; read-only handles cannot write. SQL, FileStorage and maintenance are not handle APIs; drop/rename and external/system query I/O reject. Unsupported custom/coordinated/decorated providers and Shared private storage/caller streams reject handles; Direct caller streams remain supported. Existing interface implementers gain no required members. Legacy signatures remain with CS0618 warnings and a documented warnings-as-errors migration. Known committed outcomes survive cleanup errors; disposed facade access throws `ObjectDisposedException`. Parameterless Shared begin remains unbounded; opt-in timeout/cancellation bounds begin admission separately from collection `TIMEOUT`.
